] [:script {} "$('#other_games_select').change(function(){location.href='/results/' + $('#other_games_select').val();})"]] " | " [:a {:href "/event_names/636"} "Event type"]] [:h1 {:class "event_title"} "Lightweight (≤69 kg), Men" [:small {}]] [:table {:class "biodata"} [:tbody {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Date"] [:td {} "20 September 2000 — 10:30 (B), 18:30 (A)"]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Status"] [:td {} "Olympic"]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Location"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/venues/777"} "Sydney Convention Centre, Sydney Convention and Exhibition Centre, Sydney, New South Wales"] " (Convention Centre)"]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Participants"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/events/30178"} "17 from 14 countries"]]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Format"] [:td {:colspan "2"} "Total of best lifts in snatch and clean &amp; jerk determined placement.  Ties broken by lightest bodyweight."]]]] [:div {:class "description"} [:p {} "When this class started, three Bulgarians had already tested positive for doping during the Sydney Olympics which, by the rules in force at the time, meant the expuslion of the entire Bulgarian weightlifting team. However, the expulsion was not announced until 22 September, allowing the Bulgarians in this class to compete, with 1999 World Champion " [:a {:href "/athletes/94926"} "Galabin Boevski"] " equalling the world record to win the gold medal and defeat his teammate, " [:a {:href ""} "Georgi Markov"] " for the gold medal. Both Boevski and Markov were caught doping at the 2003 World Championships, when they were found to have tampered with their urine samples. Boevski was banned from international competition for eight years, effectively ending his career, and Markov for 18 months. In October 2011 Boevski was arrested at the São Paulo International Airport when he was found to have 9 kg of cocaine in his luggage. He was convicted of cocaine trafficking and sentenced to nine years in Brazilian prison, although he was released in October 2013 and returned to Bulgaria, although the reasons for the release were unclear."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "Kilograms"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/94926"} "Galabin Boevski"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/BUL"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/BUL.png"}] "BUL"]] [:td {} "357.5"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {} [:span {:class "label label-default"} [:abbrev {:title "Olympic Record"} "OR"]]] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/94929"} "Georgi Markov"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/BUL"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/BUL.png"}] "BUL"]] [:td {} "352.5"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/94924"} "Siarhei Laurenau"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/BLR"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/BLR.png"}] "BLR"]] [:td {} "340.0"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Bronze"} "Bronze"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "4"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/94706"} "Zhang Guozheng"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/CHN"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/CHN.png"}] "CHN"]] [:td {} "337.5"] [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "5"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/94906"} "Rudik Petrosyan"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/ARM"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/ARM.png"}] "ARM"]] [:td {} "335.0"] [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style "